  "purpose": "The ten Batch C 'grey' texts of Army Group North, 29-30 September 1941, that carry no Enigma-type six-letter indicator. Used as the positive control of phase5-jless-flat-v1: texts of the J-less system Weierud and Ostwald describe.",
  "source": {
    "title": "Olaf Ostwald, 'Grey Messages from 29 & 30 Sep 1941' (working note, 2 August 2023, 9 pages, German)",
    "received": "Attached to Frode Weierud's email to the maintainer of 2026-10-11 (private correspondence). The note itself is not committed.",
